sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React UI
    participant C as PyodideWorkerClient
    participant W as PyodideWorker
    participant P as Python

    Note over C,W: Request with id becomes a promise.<br/>Event without id goes to a callback.

    UI->>C: runCode(code)
    C->>W: postMessage({id, StartRunCode})
    W->>P: runPythonAsync(code)
    P-->>W: print output
    W->>C: postMessage({Stdout}) [no id]
    C->>UI: onStdout callback
    P-->>W: code finished
    W-->>C: postMessage({id, RunCodeDone})
    C-->>UI: resolve promise

